    "output": "既有{ok:true,reauthRequired:true}",
    "permissions": "当前本人、同源、当前密码+新TOTP新鲜验证，撤销全部会话"
  },
  {
    "method": "POST",
    "path": "/api/admin/account/2fa/reset",
    "input": "TOTP_RESET actionGrant；兼容旧currentPassword+totp也执行相同规则；恢复码不得走此捷径",
    "output": "既有ok/reenrollRequired/enrollLink字段；设受限恢复cookie，链接转受限重绑页",
    "permissions": "本人新鲜验证；最终新绑定前原有效因素保留，临时重绑记录受限"
  },
  {
    "method": "POST",
    "path": "/api/admin/users/[id]/reset-2fa",
    "input": "RECOVERY_AUTHORIZE actionGrant(target=id)、reason",
    "output": "受限RecoveryPermitDTO；旧UI迁移消费一次性permit，无无验证直重置旁路",
    "permissions": "ADMIN、不能自己、同源；旧无body直接重置请求拒绝"
  },
  {
    "method": "GET",
    "path": "/api/admin/account",
